{"l":6364,"g":7,"b":3,"cefr":"B1","role":"challenge","insight":"reframing","k":"l","variant":"authored","q":"Læs: 'The film was supposed to start at seven. At half past, the screen was still black, and people were starting to complain.' Hvorfor begyndte folk at klage?","o":["Filmen var kedelig","Billetterne var dyre","Filmen var forsinket","Lyden var for høj"],"a":"Filmen var forsinket","r":"Klokken halv otte var skærmen stadig sort, så filmen var en halv time forsinket."},
