{"l":6546,"g":7,"b":3,"cefr":"B1","role":"challenge","insight":"reframing","k":"l","variant":"authored","q":"Læs: 'The forecast promised sunshine, so we left our raincoats at home. By lunchtime, we were sheltering under a tree.' Hvad skete der ved frokosttid?","o":["Solen skinnede hele dagen","Det begyndte at regne","De spiste frokost i et træ","De mistede deres jakker"],"a":"Det begyndte at regne","r":"De søgte ly under et træ uden regnjakker, så det må have regnet."},
